            "Enriches lead and company information",
            "Collects industry, company size, job role, location, and other details",
            "Sends the collected information for lead evaluation"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Lead Qualification",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "p": "The system evaluates each lead based on:"
        },
        {
          "list": [
            "Company fit",
            "Decision maker status",
            "Budget",
            "Urgency",
            "Service requirements",
            "Engagement"
          ]
        },
        {
          "p": "Leads receive a score and are classified as:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Hot → Warm → Cold → Enterprise",
      "blocks": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Automated Routing",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "p": "Each lead follows a different workflow based on its qualification:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Hot Leads",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "list": [
            "Updates the CRM",
